profile:
Heavy metal & power metal band from Buenos Aires, Argentina, active 1999-2005. All the members already had or acquired vast experience in metal, some in bands with greater repercussion than Cuero. 

Maximiliano Batista Bass ex-Alma Matter; 
Pablo Garrocho Drums ex-Ariadna Project, ex-The Road Vultures; 
Christian Vidal Guitars Therion, Luciferian Light Orchestra (live), Full Nothing, ex-Magnos, ex-The Road Vultures, ex-Symphonic Rhapsody of Queen (live); 
Enrique Gómez Yafal Vocals, Yafal
